SEL: fixed parsing of SER and history events: non-ASCII bytes no longer crash directory parses, SER element names with spaces (``GROUND O/C 1 LINE 1``, ``Power-up``) and 351/400-series history reports are parsed, SER and history events with the same number are no longer merged, the relay's date format (``DATE_F``) is used, and the ``id`` command output no longer drops its last two fields.
